# TOON v3.0 – Architecture Contract
# .agent/specs/contracts/pix-em-processamento.contract.toon
# Feature: .agent/specs/features/pix-em-processamento.spec.toon (FT-004)
# Decisions: .agent/plans/pix-em-processamento-architecture.md

contract:
  feature-ref: FT-004
  version: 0.2.0-SNAPSHOT

layers:
  demo:
    files[8]{path,action,description}:
      decoy-guard-demo/src/main/java/io/github/valossa515/decoyguard/demo/account/AccountService.java,modify,New nested enum PixStatus (EM_PROCESSAMENTO and CONCLUIDO). PixReceipt.status becomes PixStatus and PixReceipt gets a withStatus copy helper (amendment 2026-11-10). New method PixReceipt findPix(String endToEndId)
      decoy-guard-demo/src/main/java/io/github/valossa515/decoyguard/demo/account/PixNotFoundException.java,create,RuntimeException with message Pix não encontrado thrown by both implementations
      decoy-guard-demo/src/main/java/io/github/valossa515/decoyguard/demo/account/RealAccountService.java,modify,pix returns EM_PROCESSAMENTO and stores the receipt by id under the existing lock. findPix makes one hop then returns the receipt with CONCLUIDO once clock.instant() is not before at plus demo.pix-settlement and throws PixNotFoundException for an unknown id. Settlement read with @Value and validated in the constructor
      decoy-guard-demo/src/main/java/io/github/valossa515/decoyguard/demo/account/DecoyAccountService.java,modify,pix returns EM_PROCESSAMENTO and uses one clock instant for the held transaction and the receipt. findPix rebuilds the receipt from the held transactions of the current session always as EM_PROCESSAMENTO and throws PixNotFoundException when absent
      decoy-guard-demo/src/main/java/io/github/valossa515/decoyguard/demo/account/AccountController.java,modify,GET /account/pix/{endToEndId} delegating to findPix and an ExceptionHandler mapping PixNotFoundException to 404 with the error map
      decoy-guard-demo/src/main/resources/application.yml,modify,demo.pix-settlement 5s with a comment
      decoy-guard-demo/src/main/resources/static/app.js,modify,Label for EM_PROCESSAMENTO. One receipt render function. Consultation of /account/pix/{id} every 2 seconds while the receipt is open and the status is not CONCLUIDO. Timer cleared on leaving the screen or logout or final status. A failed consultation is tried again unless the session ended or the answer is 404 (amendment 2026-11-10). All inside mountPhone
      decoy-guard-demo/src/main/resources/static/styles.css,modify,Receipt look while in processing. index.html changes only if the icon needs a hook and never with a mode marker
  tests:
    files[3]{path,action,description}:
      decoy-guard-demo/src/test/java/io/github/valossa515/decoyguard/demo/PixProcessingTest.java,create,MockMvc tests for AC-01 to AC-09 with a mutable Clock fake as a Primary bean in a TestConfiguration plus the negative settlement check (amendment 2026-11-10)
      decoy-guard-demo/src/test/java/io/github/valossa515/decoyguard/demo/DuressFlowTest.java,modify,The duress Pix expects EM_PROCESSAMENTO instead of CONCLUIDO
      decoy-guard-demo/src/test/java/io/github/valossa515/decoyguard/demo/FrontEndTest.java,modify,One test for AC-10
  docs:
    files[10]{path,action,description}:
      README.md,modify,Walkthrough shows EM_PROCESSAMENTO and the consultation. Roadmap gets the item checked
      docs/threat-model.md,modify,Receiving side limitation updated with the mitigation and what stays observable. Plausibility row updated
      .agent/project-reference.md,modify,New method and enum and exception and endpoint and property
      .agent/decisions.md,modify,ADR-013
      .agent/context.md,modify,Held Pix flow says EM_PROCESSAMENTO and mentions the consultation (amendment 2026-11-10)
      .agent/glossary.md,modify,PixStatus values replace the single CONCLUIDO status (amendment 2026-11-10)
      .agent/plans/pix-em-processamento.md,modify,Status and links to contract and test plan and tasks checked
      .agent/plans/pix-em-processamento-tests.md,create,Test plan
      .agent/plans/duress-session-routing.md,modify,AC-03 wording says the status is EM_PROCESSAMENTO since FT-004
      .agent/specs/acceptance/duress-session-routing.acceptance.toon,modify,AC-03 wording says the status is EM_PROCESSAMENTO since FT-004

migrations[0]:

dependencies:
  uses[6]:
    HeldTransactionStore.findBySession (existing core SPI)
    DuressContextHolder (existing)
    Clock bean from ClockConfiguration (existing)
    CoreBankingLatency (existing)
    EndToEndIds (existing)
    SessionInterceptor on /account/** (existing)
  introduces[0]:

configuration[1]{property,type,default,notes}:
  demo.pix-settlement,Duration,5s,Demo only. Must not be negative. Read by RealAccountService only

endpoints[1]{method,path,success,errors}:
  GET,/account/pix/{endToEndId},200 with PixReceipt (endToEndId and key and amount and at and status),404 error map Pix não encontrado and 401 without a session

error-handling[4]{case,behavior}:
  Unknown end to end id in the real service,One hop then PixNotFoundException mapped to 404 with the error map
  Unknown end to end id in the decoy,PixNotFoundException mapped to the same 404. The latency shaper delays it like a failed real consultation
  Id of a Pix of the other mode,Not found in both directions with the same 404
  Negative demo.pix-settlement,Startup fails with IllegalArgumentException

test-strategy:
  unit-tests:
  integration-tests:
    - target: Demo account API (PixProcessingTest)
      type: mockmvc
      scenarios[10]:
        normal-pix-starts-in-processing
        duress-pix-starts-in-processing-with-the-same-fields-and-headers
        real-pix-settles-after-the-settlement-time
        held-pix-stays-in-processing-after-the-settlement-time
        consultation-matches-the-original-receipt-in-both-sessions
        unknown-and-other-mode-ids-return-the-same-404-in-both-sessions
        balance-drops-while-the-pix-is-in-processing
        held-pix-is-listed-by-the-fraud-desk-and-real-balance-is-unchanged
        consultation-without-a-session-returns-401
        negative-settlement-is-rejected
    - target: Static front end (FrontEndTest)
      type: mockmvc
      scenarios[1]:
        script-has-the-processing-label-and-consults-the-pix-from-the-phone-code
    - target: Existing duress flow (DuressFlowTest)
      type: mockmvc
      scenarios[1]:
        duress-pix-is-held-and-in-processing
  excluded[3]{target,reason}:
    PixStatus and PixNotFoundException,No logic
    RealAccountService and DecoyAccountService in isolation,The project tests the demo through HTTP. The only exception is the constructor check of the settlement time
    Receipt polling in a browser,No browser test in the build. Covered by the manual check done in review on 2026-11-10

rules-check[5]{rule,how}:
  Mode never observable by the client,Same status on the first receipt and same fields and same 404 and 401 in both modes. No header or cookie or log line added
  Real and decoy share DTOs,One PixReceipt and one PixStatus and one PixNotFoundException. findPix is implemented in both with a parity test
  Decoy beans never injectable,Untouched. The controller injects AccountService
  Alert failures never fail the request,Untouched
  New storage is an SPI,No new library storage. Receipts in RealAccountService are state of the fake core banking like its balance. The decoy reads the existing HeldTransactionStore
